          <a class="row-card__heading glue-link" href=https://research.google/pubs/aase-activation-based-ai-safety-enforcement-via-lightweight-probes/ >
            
              AASE: Activation-Based AI Safety Enforcement via Lightweight Probes
            
          </a>
        
        <div class="row-card__subheading">
          
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__item small-text">
                      
                        <a class="row-card__small-link" href="/people/glenmessenger/">
                          Glen Messenger
                        </a>
                      
                    </div>
                
              
            
          
          
